    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "channel.set(Name=\"input\", Goal=goal.call(Name=\"Question\"))",
      "line": {
        "number": 27
      },
      "comment": "A question for the user (a permission, `ask user \"…\"`) is a dialog on the screen: asked on the\nconsole, it would go into the screen's pipe and wait on the host's input.",
