          "comment": "New files for this shell from the host (its %!app.parent%; staged on Windows in shell.next): each written into the\nshell's folder, then the desktop loads again. Pages show the change now; a changed goal (.build/*.pr) is used when\nPlangOS starts again. No image, nothing in /home/plang touched.",
