          },
          "comment": "The window's app came with PlangOS: it is in the image, and the next image replaces it. Its first change makes it\nthe person's: copied into their app (/app/<name>, on the data disk, which a new image never touches) — and what it\ncame from beside it (/app/.base/<name>), to compare with a newer PlangOS's — then the window shows the copy. The\nchange, and every one after it, is made in the copy.",
